BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Book Launch:
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260126T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260126T214500
UID:39864d079aa2ed8d6ce234ac@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special evening with Vishvapani Blomfield\, expl
 oring his new book Reimagining Buddhism: Understanding Sangharakshita. In 
 this thoughtful and timely work\, Vishvapani reflects on the life and lega
 cy of Sangharakshita\, founder of the Triratna Buddhist Community\, and co
 nsiders how Buddhism can be reinterpreted for our times. The evening will 
 include readings\, reflections\, and discussion\, offering a chance to eng
 age with fresh perspectives on the Buddha’s teaching and its relevance t
 oday.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/book-launch-2026-01-26
END:VEVENT
